menu "Doom lab options"

config DOOM_LCD_BUS_SPI
    bool "Drive the panel over SPI instead of the i80 parallel bus"
    default n
    help
        The physical board uses a 34-pin 8080 parallel panel through LCD_CAM.
        The packaged LabWired twin models the same I80 path. Leave this
        alternative SPI option disabled for the MRB3205 carrier.
        Same controller and init sequence either way.

endmenu
